# A third player's entry keeps the process going even when the first two players declined.
[Bot1 Deck]
Eureka
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Forest x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Bot3 Deck]
Plains x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Eureka.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose()
Bot2.Choose()
Bot3.Choose(Plains)
Bot1.Choose(Forest)
Bot2.Choose()
Bot3.Choose()
Bot1.Choose()
Bot2.Choose()
Bot3.Choose()
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Forest
Bot3.Battlefield = Plains
